    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOLB-lzc8AAAABL4fvIQ",
      "title": "zk: align ZK dispute game specs with the implementation",
      "author": "wwared",
      "number": 983,
      "body": "Brings the ZK dispute game specs in line with the monorepo implementation: fixes outdated contract details (game type, `SuperRootProof` encoding, verifier, OPCM config and validation, game mechanics), adds the public interface reference, rewrites migration around `upgrade()`/`migrate()`, documents the SP1 program structure and proof completeness, and adds an honest actors page. The ZK Fault Proof VM page is renamed to ZK Proof System (with a redirect), and the dispute game interface, portal and OPCM migrator pages get matching fixes.\n\nCloses ethereum-optimism/proofs-team#9. Commits are self-contained and can be reviewed one by one.",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/specs",
